  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2501.08 Medical condition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2501.08 \"Medical condition\" means a disease or ailment aggravated by exposure to the sun for which applicants may obtain a waiver of the after market tinting restriction if they qualify pursuant to this chapter.\n\nSource. #10083, eff 1-31-12 (from Saf-C 2501.05); ss by #13416, eff 7-25-22; ss by #14218, INTERIM, eff 3-25-25, EXPIRES: 9-21-25; ss by #14382, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35 (formerly Saf-C 2501.07)",
